sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as Next.js API
    participant BetterAuth as Better-Auth
    participant Postgres as Postgres Database
    participant Cache as Next.js Cache

    User->>UI: Click Organization Switcher
    UI->>API: GET /api/user/organizations

    API->>BetterAuth: Get current session
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query session + user
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: User data

    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query all organizations<br/>user is member of
    Note over Postgres: JOIN organization_member<br/>WHERE userId = current user

    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: List of organizations<br/>with roles
    BetterAuth-->>API: Organizations data
    API-->>UI: Return org list

    UI->>User: Show organization dropdown
    Note over User,UI: Display:<br/>- Current org (highlighted)<br/>- Available orgs<br/>- User's role in each

    User->>UI: Select different organization
    UI->>UI: Show loading state

    UI->>API: POST /api/user/switch-organization<br/>{ organizationId: "new-org-123" }

    API->>BetterAuth: Get current session
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query session
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session data

    API->>BetterAuth: Verify user membership
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Check organization_member<br/>WHERE userId AND organizationId
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Membership record + role

    alt User is not a member
        BetterAuth-->>API: Error: Not a member
        API-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
        UI->>User: Show error message
    else User is a member
        BetterAuth->>Postgres: UPDATE session<br/>SET activeOrganizationId = new-org-123
        Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session updated

        Note over BetterAuth: Session now points to new org<br/>All subsequent requests use new context

        BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query new organization data
        Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Org details, workspaces

        BetterAuth-->>API: Switch successful

        API->>Cache: Invalidate user cache tags
        Note over Cache: revalidateTag('user-data')<br/>revalidateTag('org-data')

        API-->>UI: 200 OK<br/>{ organization: {...}, workspaces: [...] }

        UI->>UI: Update React Query cache
        Note over UI: Invalidate queries:<br/>- current user<br/>- organization data<br/>- workspace list

        UI->>UI: Update local state
        Note over UI: Set active organization<br/>in client state

        UI->>User: Show success message
        UI->>UI: Refresh dashboard data

        par Parallel Data Fetching
            UI->>API: Fetch org-specific data
            UI->>API: Fetch workspace list
            UI->>API: Fetch user permissions
        end

        API-->>UI: New organization context data
        UI->>User: Render updated dashboard
    end

    Note over User,Postgres: All subsequent API calls<br/>automatically use new organization context<br/>from session.activeOrganizationId

    User->>UI: Make API call to workspace
    UI->>API: POST /api/databricks/query<br/>(no org specified in request)

    API->>BetterAuth: Get session
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query session
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session with activeOrganizationId

    API->>Postgres: Get workspace OAuth token<br/>for active organization
    Note over Postgres: Query workspace accounts<br/>WHERE org = session.activeOrganizationId

    Postgres-->>API: Correct workspace token
    API->>API: Execute query with token
    API-->>UI: Query results
    UI->>User: Display data
